    "content" : "I got this awesome LCD shield over a year ago from the <a href=\"http://43oh.com\" class=\"ot-anchor\">43oh.com</a> web store. I tried using it before but realized I needed a 20-pin MSP430 chip to get it working, while the launchpad only comes with a 14-pin chip. I placed an order for the new chips and spent some time with the code today and finally got it working. I&#39;m not sure what I&#39;m going to use it for but it&#39;s nice to know that it works. It&#39;s definitely nice to have all these lines for text. Anybody have any ideas for what I should do with it?",
    "objectType" : "note",
    "originalContent" : "I got this awesome LCD shield over a year ago from the 43oh.com web store. I tried using it before but realized I needed a 20-pin MSP430 chip to get it working, while the launchpad only comes with a 14-pin chip. I placed an order for the new chips and spent some time with the code today and finally got it working. I'm not sure what I'm going to use it for but it's nice to know that it works. It's definitely nice to have all these lines for text. Anybody have any ideas for what I should do with it?",
